# Pairs with RestoredCutNotReAdvanced. The park does not re-read the fence: a
# pre-cutover delivery a stale cached gate admitted is parked under the current
# epoch, and drains onto the restored copy after the lift.
MODULE: RestoredCutNotReAdvancedParkWhilePaused
TARGET: RestoredCutNotReAdvanced
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a park trusts the cached admission and stamps the current epoch
PERTURBS: Park

--- FIND
       IN IF ~recvOn[d] \/ r.ep < epoch[d]
--- REPLACE
       IN \* MUTATION: no uncached re-read at park.
          IF FALSE
--- END
